"culture_trait_craft_flame_weapon": "Flame and Scale Items",
"culture_trait_craft_flame_weapon_info": "The art of forging items imbued with the fierce power of fire",
"culture_trait_craft_ice_weapon": "Ice Items",
"culture_trait_craft_ice_weapon_info": "Masters of forging items that harness the biting cold",
