"culture_trait_Helmet Lovers": "Helmet Lovers",
"culture_trait_Helmet Lovers_info": "Will forge helmets instead of headbands. A type of headwear that provides significant protection with some drawbacks",
"culture_trait_Helmet Lovers_info_2": "Great for anonymity on the battlefield",
"culture_trait_Headband Lovers": "Headband Lovers",
"culture_trait_Headband Lovers_info": "Will forge headbands instead of helmets. A type of headwear that allows for more movement in exchange for lesser protection",
"culture_trait_Headband Lovers_info_2": "Leaves the heads of warriors exposed, speed comes at a price",
"culture_trait_Armor Lovers": "Armor Lovers",
"culture_trait_Armor Lovers_info": "Armor is what protects warriors, this culture values resistance in battles",
"culture_trait_Armor Lovers_info_2": "Better to be able to take more hits than die in one",
"culture_trait_Cloak Lovers": "Cloak Lovers",
"culture_trait_Cloak Lovers_info": "This culture prefers a more flexible armor piece for quicker movement and attacks",
"culture_trait_Cloak Lovers_info_2": "Or they just like the mage aesthetic",
"culture_trait_Boot Lovers": "Boot Lovers",
"culture_trait_Boot Lovers_info": "This culture prefers sturdy and protective footwear",
"culture_trait_Boot Lovers_info_2": "Good for marching too",
"culture_trait_Highcleat Lovers": "Highcleat Lovers",
"culture_trait_Highcleat Lovers_info": "Likes to forge more specialized footwear that allows for better hikes across all terrain",
"culture_trait_Highcleat Lovers_info_2": "Sucks more than normal for victims who get stepped on",
"culture_trait_Ring Lovers": "Ring Lovers",
"culture_trait_Ring Lovers_info": "Prefers to make little finger circles with special gemstones",
"culture_trait_Ring Lovers_info_2": "They somehow fit on all finger sizes!",
"culture_trait_Earring Lovers": "Earring Lovers",
"culture_trait_Earring Lovers_info": "This culture values making ears look cool",
"culture_trait_Earring Lovers_info_2": "Look very nice when the light hits them right",
"culture_trait_Amulet Lovers": "Amulet Lovers",
"culture_trait_Amulet Lovers_info": "Prefers to craft amulets that can hang around their necks",
"culture_trait_Amulet Lovers_info_2": "Can sometimes put super secret (or event plot relevant) picutres inside of them",
"culture_trait_Bracelet Lovers": "Bracelet Lovers",
"culture_trait_Bracelet Lovers_info": "Forging fancy loops for arms is the culture's preference",
"culture_trait_Bracelet Lovers_info_2": "Technically could go on ankles too",

"culture_trait_Bludgeon Lovers": "Bludgeon Lovers",
"culture_trait_Bludgeon Lovers_info": "Wielding weapons with immeasurable strength is what this culture values",
"culture_trait_Bludgeon Lovers_info_2": "Hit hard enough in one swing and your enemies will never stand again",
"culture_trait_Halberd Lovers": "Halberd Lovers",
"culture_trait_Halberd Lovers_info": "Prefers to craft halberds, a weapon that challenges the dominance of spears in ranged melee combat",
"culture_trait_Halberd Lovers_info_2": "The great spear-axe!",
"culture_trait_Dagger Lovers": "Dagger Lovers",
"culture_trait_Dagger Lovers_info": "Prefers to craft daggers, a perfect weapon for taking down weaker enemies quickly.",
"culture_trait_Dagger Lovers_info_2": "Stabbing is fun!",
"culture_trait_Crossbow Lovers": "Crossbow Lovers",
"culture_trait_Crossbow Lovers_info": "This culture values precision in keeping its enemies at a distance",
"culture_trait_Crossbow Lovers_info_2": "The deadly whistle of arrows is replaced by the snap of a string",
